      "immunities": null,
      "lore": "The tablet is worn almost smooth, but the rite is still legible where a patient thumb has traced it a thousand times. \"The seal was set by two and is broken by two. Let one Warden stand upon the North Ward and another upon the South, in the same moment, and the way will open to them both. Do not send one alone into the wards hoping to hold both discs by running between them -- the sanctum is older than your legs, and it counts. It has always counted. Go together, or remain.\"",
